    <section anchor="security-considerations" numbered="true" removeInRFC="false" toc="include" pn="section-3">
      <name slugifiedName="name-security-considerations">Security Considerations</name>
      <t indent="0" pn="section-3-1">This document focuses on IANA considerations for the PPPoE protocol,
and as such, should help remove the possibility of the same PPPoE
code field and PPPoE TAG value being used for different
functionalities.</t>
    </section>
